<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  2.54 %			C/S =  2.54 %</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.54 %			O/N =  2.54 %</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.54 %			T/N =  2.54 %</p>
<p>		   Feb  24, 1997			Feb 21, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.76 %     1 month forward =  5.08 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.29 %     2 month forward =  6.61 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.34 %     3 month forward =  6.89 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.29 %     4 month forward =  6.95 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.59 %     5 month forward =  7.19 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.47 %     6 month forward =  7.13 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
